vars {
  baseUrl: http://localhost:3001
  deviceId: bruno-device-1
  centerEmail: owner+bruno@example.com
  centerPassword: a-strong-password
}

vars:secret [
  accessToken,
  refreshToken,
  verificationToken,
  resetCode
]

docs {
  Change `centerEmail` before each full run. A verified account cannot verify
  again, so step 02 fails on a reused address. `owner+bruno2@example.com`,
  `+bruno3`, and so on works — the plus-suffix is a distinct address to the
  API but reaches the same inbox.

  `accessToken` and `refreshToken` are written for you by the post-response
  scripts on steps 02, 03, 04 and 07.

  `verificationToken` and `resetCode` are emailed, never returned in a
  response. Read them from the server console and paste them in before running
  steps 02 and 07.
}
